3eOptimised for long-distance viewing and large-format installations. Punchy 8,000-nit brightness, quick-lock die-cast aluminium cabinets, and remote diagnostics for billboard networks.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the pixel pitch of the Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm LED display and why is it important?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe pixel pitch is 6.8mm, which determines the display's resolution and viewing distance. A 6.8mm pitch is optimized for clear, sharp images visible from 6 meters or more, ideal for large-format outdoor billboards.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow bright is the Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm display and can it handle direct sunlight?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWith a brightness of 8,000 nits, this display ensures vivid visibility even in direct sunlight. It is specifically designed for outdoor environments where high brightness is essential for readability.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat types of environments can the Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm withstand?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe display features an IP65 rating and a rugged die-cast aluminium cabinet, making it dustproof and water-resistant. It operates reliably in temperatures from -30 to 60 degrees Celsius, suitable for harsh outdoor climates.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow easy is installation and maintenance for this LED display?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe panels use quick-lock mechanisms in die-cast aluminium cabinets for fast assembly and secure installation. Additionally, remote diagnostics enable efficient monitoring and troubleshooting, reducing maintenance time and costs.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\