d large-format installations. Punchy 8,000-nit brightness, quick-lock die-cast aluminium cabinets, and remote diagnostics for billboard networks.\", \"sku\": \"BL-OBX680\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-obx680\", \"category\": \"outdoor\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-obx680.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 600, \"highPrice\": 5000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-obx680\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"6.8mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"8,000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"128 x 128 per panel\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Ta0c,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm LED display and why is it important?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 6.8mm, which determines the display's resolution and viewing distance. A 6.8mm pitch is optimized for clear, sharp images visible from 6 meters or more, ideal for large-format outdoor billboards.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm display and can it handle direct sunlight?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness of 8,000 nits, this display ensures vivid visibility even in direct sunlight. It is specifically designed for outdoor environments where high brightness is essential for readability.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of environments can the Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm withstand?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display features an IP65 rating and a rugged die-cast aluminium cabinet, making it dustproof and water-resistant. It operates reliably in temperatures from -30 to 60 degrees Celsius, suitable for harsh outdoor climates.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How easy is installation and maintenance for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The panels use quick-lock mechanisms in die-cast aluminium cabinets for fast assembly and secure installation. Additionally, remote diagnostics enable efficient monitoring and troubleshooting, reducing maintenance time and costs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty does Brightluxx offer for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm comes with a 5-year warranty, reflecting our confidence in its durability and performance for long-term outdoor use.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this LED display compare with alternatives of smaller pixel pitches?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Compared to finer pixel pitches, the 6.8mm pitch is optimized for long-distance viewing, offering a balance between resolution and cost-effectiveness for large outdoor installations like billboards and stadiums.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the typical applications for the Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This product excels in large-format outdoor advertising such as billboards and sports stadium screens, where high brightness, durability, and remote monitoring are crucial.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-obx680\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T69d,<h1>Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm</h1><p>Get reliable Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm LED Displays for UAE. Perfect for large outdoor ads in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx for premium solutions!</p><p><strong>Large-format digital billboards. Built to last.</strong></p><p>Optimised for long-distance viewing and large-format installations. Punchy 8,000-nit brightness, quick-lock die-cast aluminium cabinets, and remote diagnostics for billboard networks.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm LED display and why is it important?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 6.8mm, which determines the display's resolution and viewing distance. A 6.8mm pitch is optimized for clear, sharp images visible from 6 meters or more, ideal for large-format outdoor billboards.</p><h3>How bright is the Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm display and can it handle direct sunlight?</h3><p>With a brightness of 8,000 nits, this display ensures vivid visibility even in direct sunlight. It is specifically designed for outdoor environments where high brightness is essential for readability.</p><h3>What types of environments can the Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm withstand?</h3><p>The display features an IP65 rating and a rugged die-cast aluminium cabinet, making it dustproof and water-resistant. It operates reliably in temperatures from -30 to 60 degrees Celsius, suitable for harsh outdoor climates.</p><h3>How easy is installation and maintenance for this LED display?</h3><p>The panels use quick-lock mechanisms in die-cast aluminium cabinets for fast assembly and secure installation. Additionally, remote diagnostics enable efficient monitoring and troubleshooting, reducing maintenance time and costs.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm LED Display for UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Get reliable Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm LED Displays for UAE. Perfect for large outdoor ads in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx for premium solutions!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-obx680\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"products/bl-obx680\",\"siblings\":[\"p