e\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of environments can the Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm withstand?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display features an IP65 rating and a rugged die-cast aluminium cabinet, making it dustproof and water-resistant. It operates reliably in temperatures from -30 to 60 degrees Celsius, suitable for harsh outdoor climates.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How easy is installation and maintenance for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The panels use quick-lock mechanisms in die-cast aluminium cabinets for fast assembly and secure installation. Additionally, remote diagnostics enable efficient monitoring and troubleshooting, reducing maintenance time and costs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty does Brightluxx offer for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm comes with a 5-year warranty, reflecting our confidence in its durability and performance for long-term outdoor use.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this LED display compare with alternatives of smaller pixel pitches?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Compared to finer pixel pitches, the 6.8mm pitch is optimized for long-distance viewing, offering a balance between resolution and cost-effectiveness for large outdoor installations like billboards and stadiums.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the typical applications for the Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This product excels in large-format outdoor advertising such as billboards and sports stadium screens, where high brightness, durability, and remote monitoring are crucial.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":