es\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n14:T69d,<h1>Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm</h1><p>Get reliable Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm LED Displays for UAE. Perfect for large outdoor ads in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx for premium solutions!</p><p><strong>Large-format digital billboards. Built to last.</strong></p><p>Optimised for long-distance viewing and large-format installations. Punchy 8,000-nit brightness, quick-lock die-cast aluminium cabinets, and remote diagnostics for billboard networks.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm LED display and why is it important?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 6.8mm, which determines the display's resolution and viewing distance. A 6.8mm pitch is optimized for clear, sharp images visible from 6 meters or more, ideal for large-format outdoor billboards.</p><h3>How bright is the Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm display and can it handle direct sunlight?</h3><p>With a brightness of 8,000 nits, this display ensures vivid visibility even in direct sunlight. It is specifically designed for outdoor environments where high brightness is essential for readability.</p><h3>What types of environments can the Outdoor Brilliance 6.8mm withstand?</h3><p>The display features an IP65 rating and a rugged die-cast aluminium cabinet, making it dustproof and water-resistant. It operates reliably in temperatures from -30 to 60 degrees Celsius, suitable for harsh outdoor climates.</p><h3>How easy is installation and maintenance for this LED display?</h3><p>The panels use quick-lock mechanisms in die-cast aluminium cabinets for fast assembly and secure installation. Additionally, remote diagnostics enable efficient monitoring and troubleshooting, reducing maintenance time and costs.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\